WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:08.260
<i>Can you imagine a life where you 
can't even touch the person you love?</i>

00:09.130 --> 00:14.170
<i>The curse the witch laid upon him caused 
him to take the lives of any he touched.</i>

00:14.750 --> 00:19.090
<i>His own mother distanced herself from 
him, his friends called him a monster...</i>

00:19.090 --> 00:23.440
<i>Even people he'd never met spoke of him as 
"death incarnate that dwells in the forest."</i>

00:24.150 --> 00:29.210
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

00:39.790 --> 00:44.680
Viola says she always falls in love 
with older guys, so I asked her...

00:45.220 --> 00:49.470
Wouldn't it be sad to have the person 
you love pass away before you?

00:50.560 --> 00:52.150
What she says is...

00:52.760 --> 00:58.270
She'd rather be sad than make 
the person she loves sad.

01:01.790 --> 01:03.270
What do you think, Zain?

01:03.880 --> 01:04.830
I...

01:05.180 --> 01:08.110
It's too complicated for me to understand.

01:08.110 --> 01:09.040
Dummy.

01:12.460 --> 01:13.510
I...

01:14.820 --> 01:16.910
I don't want to be alone.

01:18.930 --> 01:22.760
You'll never leave me, right Zain?

01:30.290 --> 01:32.150
Cuff, for your sake...

01:33.260 --> 01:34.880
I would.

03:11.960 --> 03:15.360
Episode 16
The Duke, Alice, and Circus 101

03:14.420 --> 03:17.830
How do you feel in that mask, Your Grace?

03:17.830 --> 03:20.880
I like it! It's lighter than the last one!

03:21.250 --> 03:24.150
During the festival it 
was so heavy I fell over.

03:25.760 --> 03:30.010
Even at this size, it's okay 
for you to touch people.

03:30.010 --> 03:32.830
Yeah, but you're so cute!

03:39.070 --> 03:41.580
We need to find Circus Gemini fast, though!

03:43.490 --> 03:45.570
Oh, let's ask him!

03:45.850 --> 03:47.030
Circus Gemini?

03:47.410 --> 03:49.080
It's off today.

03:49.080 --> 03:51.030
That's fine.

03:51.030 --> 03:52.810
We're here to see Cuff and Zain.

03:52.810 --> 03:53.930
What?

03:53.930 --> 03:58.990
Are you going after Cuff, too?!

03:58.990 --> 04:01.800
You shouldn't get too close to me!

04:02.320 --> 04:05.510
You can't threaten me!

04:05.510 --> 04:07.720
No! I'm cursed!

04:07.930 --> 04:11.820
Cursed? Something's wrong with you?

04:11.820 --> 04:13.050
Yeah.

04:13.050 --> 04:14.940
Do you know Cuff?

04:15.160 --> 04:18.430
Yeah, I'm part of Circus Gemini myself!

04:18.430 --> 04:19.900
My name's Hugo!

04:25.850 --> 04:30.530
That mask of yours... you're not 
Zain's brother or something, right?

04:30.530 --> 04:32.350
I'm not, no.

04:33.690 --> 04:35.750
Cuff's probably there right now.

04:52.210 --> 04:53.120
She's beautiful.

04:53.120 --> 04:53.730
Right?

04:54.600 --> 04:57.410
Oh, you came?

04:57.410 --> 05:00.640
Welcome to Circus Gemini!

05:00.640 --> 05:02.610
Oops! I let go!

05:02.880 --> 05:05.240
I guess I almost died!

05:07.890 --> 05:10.780
So Zain isn't here.

05:10.780 --> 05:13.540
Yeah, he went out drinking last 
night and hasn't come back.

05:13.540 --> 05:15.510
When he gets back, I'm giving
 him a piece of my mind.

05:15.930 --> 05:18.570
You were talking about a curse.

05:18.570 --> 05:19.710
What did you mean?

05:20.110 --> 05:21.130
Um...

05:22.420 --> 05:23.670
Watch closely.

05:26.460 --> 05:28.890
It's really a curse and not 
a magic trick, right?

05:29.430 --> 05:31.500
Yeah. Scary, right?

05:31.500 --> 05:34.470
Why? I'm not scared.

05:34.810 --> 05:37.060
Really? That's great!

05:37.060 --> 05:38.810
You're wonderful.

05:40.330 --> 05:43.070
Having something that makes you 
different makes you unique.

05:43.340 --> 05:45.730
You should join Circus Gemini.

05:47.550 --> 05:49.820
Can you really kill people?

05:50.530 --> 05:52.680
Can you shake my hand?

05:54.530 --> 05:56.840
Cuff, who is this guy?

05:56.840 --> 05:57.930
The Ringmaster.

06:02.330 --> 06:06.520
If you can't stay here forever, 
then at least 3 days...

06:06.520 --> 06:07.630
No, but...

06:08.040 --> 06:12.890
We're going to be having a special 
performance in the big plaza two days from now.

06:12.890 --> 06:16.100
During daytime, so kids can enjoy it.

06:16.100 --> 06:19.070
The plaza? I'm surprised 
they let you do that.

06:19.070 --> 06:20.720
I'm on my way to get permission now.

06:20.720 --> 06:21.810
You didn't get permission yet?

06:22.290 --> 06:24.530
That's how it always goes. 
That's the Ringmaster for you.

06:25.330 --> 06:27.420
I'm going, then.

06:28.600 --> 06:32.200
But I'm sure you'll be popular.

06:33.120 --> 06:35.410
<i>Popular... because of my curse?</i>

06:36.130 --> 06:38.270
<i>Is he an edgelord?!</i>

06:38.270 --> 06:40.620
Warm-ups are critical at the circus.

06:42.030 --> 06:44.570
Alice? Are you going to do it?

06:45.370 --> 06:49.300
Yes. They were nice enough to 
invite me, so I'd like to try.

06:55.230 --> 06:58.170
Will you join the circus?

06:59.620 --> 07:01.900
I don't think I can do it!

07:02.620 --> 07:05.860
It's your chance to learn to 
be around others, Your Grace.

07:07.240 --> 07:08.720
Why don't you try it?

07:08.720 --> 07:11.240
It's not fair of you to use that sexy voice!

07:12.820 --> 07:15.030
Here, stop whining and try it!

07:15.030 --> 07:16.930
Here, do some juggling!

07:16.930 --> 07:20.290
I'll try, but I don't think I'll be any good...

07:26.690 --> 07:28.080
That's true art.

07:29.620 --> 07:32.430
I'll teach you everything you 
need to know, just you wait!

07:32.430 --> 07:35.390
I don't think I can do it...

07:37.780 --> 07:41.400
You start doing the swing from this height.

07:41.400 --> 07:43.310
We're not far off the ground, 
but still, be careful.

07:44.010 --> 07:45.770
Thank you.

07:46.010 --> 07:46.730
<i>Glance...</i>

07:47.530 --> 07:48.730
<i>Glance...</i>

07:49.900 --> 07:51.300
<i>I bet they smell good.</i>

07:56.440 --> 07:58.830
Hey! Focus!

07:59.810 --> 08:02.830
When did you come here, Hugo?

08:05.790 --> 08:07.430
Last month.

08:07.430 --> 08:08.890
Last month?

08:08.890 --> 08:13.590
Cuff and the Ringmaster took me 
in when I was just a pickpocket.

08:13.960 --> 08:15.760
The rest of the troupe are like me.

08:16.430 --> 08:18.730
Guys who have too much strength.

08:18.730 --> 08:20.650
Former con men, thugs,

08:20.650 --> 08:22.200
people with multiple personalities...

08:22.200 --> 08:24.980
Everyone here has been rejected by society.

08:24.980 --> 08:31.050
But the Ringmaster says that it's wonderful 
to have something that makes you unique.

08:32.460 --> 08:36.540
We changed by coming here to the circus.

08:37.450 --> 08:39.510
We've found something that 
gives our lives meaning!

08:39.820 --> 08:43.120
For all the trouble we've caused people,
 we want to make them have fun!

08:43.420 --> 08:45.200
Make them smile!

08:50.010 --> 08:52.550
Now let's do it again!

08:52.550 --> 08:55.030
I'll help you until you figure it out.

08:55.030 --> 08:56.510
Th-Thanks...

08:58.090 --> 09:01.220
<i>I came here to talk about Daleth.</i>

09:01.710 --> 09:05.300
<i>But Zain's not here. I guess 
I can do this for a while.</i>

09:09.690 --> 09:11.620
Focus!

09:26.520 --> 09:30.420
It's not that I want to 
leave her behind, but...

09:45.920 --> 09:47.570
Okay, one more time!

09:47.570 --> 09:49.810
You're still practicing?

09:50.220 --> 09:51.170
Yeah.

09:51.170 --> 09:54.480
I'm a part of the circus now, 
even if only temporarily.

09:55.260 --> 09:57.690
They're so passionate about 
it that it wouldn't be right

09:57.690 --> 09:59.700
for me to not take it seriously.

10:00.260 --> 10:04.130
Because I'm like them. I can't 
lead a normal life either.

10:06.090 --> 10:07.620
Or am I being naïve?

10:08.080 --> 10:10.080
It's one of your best aspects.

10:10.490 --> 10:11.450
Really?

10:11.450 --> 10:12.180
Yes.

10:13.660 --> 10:16.300
Look! I got a little better at juggling!

10:16.300 --> 10:17.260
Watch this!

10:17.840 --> 10:20.390
I'll take a seat and watch.

10:20.390 --> 10:23.970
I can be your first audience member.

10:24.600 --> 10:26.930
Don't laugh if I mess up, okay?

10:28.060 --> 10:32.860
Ladies and gentlemen, 
welcome to Circus Gemini!

10:58.620 --> 10:59.760
Like that!

11:03.850 --> 11:05.850
Encore, please.

11:06.840 --> 11:08.350
Of that?

11:09.770 --> 11:12.600
I don't mind if you drink, 
but this is too much!

11:12.600 --> 11:15.900
Sometimes, a man wants a drink!

11:16.310 --> 11:17.340
Huh?

11:17.340 --> 11:19.460
Maybe I did drink too much.

11:19.930 --> 11:23.650
I'm hallucinating Alice...

11:27.660 --> 11:30.620
Can I touch you and see if you're real?

11:31.760 --> 11:36.040
A good punch... no, maybe two...
 will wake you up.

11:38.510 --> 11:40.790
You hit me three times!

11:40.790 --> 11:42.510
This is the real Alice!

11:43.120 --> 11:46.470
Oh, Lord Thighs is here, too.

11:46.470 --> 11:49.920
Don't call me that!

12:11.610 --> 12:12.830
Daleth!

12:13.180 --> 12:15.070
I came to hang out!

12:15.510 --> 12:19.500
Keto, did you see my face?

12:19.500 --> 12:20.970
I did not!

12:20.970 --> 12:22.310
Good.

12:22.310 --> 12:26.980
But I did get a look at what's inside that.

12:27.690 --> 12:29.610
Oh, fine.

12:29.610 --> 12:30.770
Can you keep it a secret?

12:31.070 --> 12:32.120
I can!

12:39.200 --> 12:42.700
A human woman? Is she alive?

12:42.700 --> 12:45.710
She's not breathing, but her heart does beat.

12:45.710 --> 12:47.450
She's been asleep a long, long time.

12:48.120 --> 12:52.910
I liked her quite a bit, 
and I want to help her.

12:53.580 --> 12:56.880
Ideally, I'd like to return her 
to the life she had before,

12:56.880 --> 12:58.380
like nothing ever happened.

12:58.620 --> 13:01.480
She looks like the girl 
who came to the Sabbath.

13:01.480 --> 13:03.230
She's her mother.

13:03.780 --> 13:08.570
When I saw Alice before, I thought 
she might be Sharon, actually.

13:09.610 --> 13:14.170
Fate and destiny... are real things.

13:17.370 --> 13:20.740
By the way, Keto. Do you have any 
plans for the immediate future?

13:20.740 --> 13:22.220
Nah.

13:22.220 --> 13:26.610
Maybe a date with my girlfriend Teto?

13:27.490 --> 13:32.330
Everybody else is so lucky to have a partner.
 I can't stop clucking my tongue.

13:34.850 --> 13:40.420
I'm actually going to the human world soon. 
Want to come with me? You can bring Teto.

13:40.420 --> 13:41.290
Sure.

13:42.550 --> 13:44.580
Trendy girls sure have a lot of energy.

13:44.580 --> 13:46.670
Watching the fun again?

13:46.670 --> 13:49.790
No. I'm going for a reason this time.

13:51.020 --> 13:53.140
I'm bringing Zain back.

13:54.270 --> 13:57.890
He's the traitor who brought 
a human to the Sabbath, right?

13:57.890 --> 14:00.220
That doesn't matter at all.

14:00.220 --> 14:01.900
Be more respectful.

14:02.810 --> 14:05.800
He will be a powerful witch someday.

14:06.920 --> 14:10.950
And with Zain's magic, it's possible.

14:14.480 --> 14:20.100
He's a ladies' man. If I bring you and Teto,
 he'll be easier to talk to.

14:20.100 --> 14:24.530
I'm not sexy at all, but... got it!

14:24.530 --> 14:27.050
As your subordinate, I shall accompany you!

14:27.450 --> 14:28.160
Subordinate?

14:28.160 --> 14:30.720
Maybe more like one of the Daleth Girls?

14:30.720 --> 14:31.760
That's a stupid name.

14:32.070 --> 14:34.310
I'll go get Teto!

14:34.310 --> 14:36.770
Gotta get ready fast!

14:38.650 --> 14:40.530
She's always so loud.

14:46.890 --> 14:53.040
Daleth, your face looks just like mine,
 so it's hard to tell us apart.

14:53.370 --> 14:55.990
Would it be all right if I changed that?

15:11.120 --> 15:12.430
Wow!

15:13.170 --> 15:16.390
You've totally mastered juggling!

15:17.460 --> 15:19.070
And with four at a time!

15:19.850 --> 15:21.860
You really worked hard!

15:21.860 --> 15:25.610
I thought you were a huge wimp,
 but I guess you're not!

15:27.490 --> 15:29.030
I'm impressed, yeah.

15:29.520 --> 15:32.530
But why didn't you do something 
that uses your curse?

15:37.410 --> 15:40.540
They're not coming to take our order.

15:42.550 --> 15:43.730
I can't wait anymore!

15:43.730 --> 15:44.330
I'll go get them.

15:48.710 --> 15:50.550
So, what did you want to talk about?

15:50.920 --> 15:55.280
It's, um... about your magic.

15:55.710 --> 15:58.720
It's fine. You can tell Alice.

15:59.590 --> 16:04.010
Daleth is after your time magic.

16:04.860 --> 16:08.550
I see. So Daleth already found out, huh?

16:13.050 --> 16:14.090
Sheesh.

16:14.090 --> 16:16.370
This power's such a pain.

16:18.950 --> 16:20.840
I guess it's time to go, then.

16:21.760 --> 16:22.600
Zain?

16:23.240 --> 16:25.060
I'm leaving the city.

16:26.320 --> 16:30.010
If I stay here, she might come 
after Cuff or Circus Gemini.

16:30.350 --> 16:31.490
But...

16:31.980 --> 16:33.970
Are you really okay with that?

16:35.930 --> 16:37.930
It's something I've been thinking about.

16:38.850 --> 16:43.100
Cuff's not like me. She could 
pass as a human here easily.

16:43.660 --> 16:44.600
But...

16:45.160 --> 16:48.710
You can't leave Cuff!

16:51.120 --> 16:53.040
I'm back.

16:53.040 --> 16:55.140
What are you all so serious about?

16:55.140 --> 16:55.990
We were sharing dirty jokes!

16:56.840 --> 16:59.890
You're lucky my hands are full!

16:59.890 --> 17:03.510
Why are you bringing the 
meat pies? Did you get a job here?

17:03.510 --> 17:04.860
I'm helping, that's all.

17:04.860 --> 17:06.230
Aren't I great?

17:06.230 --> 17:07.210
Y-Yeah.

17:08.840 --> 17:10.920
Now let's eat!

17:14.760 --> 17:18.640
You'll never leave me, right Zain?

17:24.570 --> 17:25.560
<i>Cuff,</i>

17:27.370 --> 17:28.840
<i>for your sake...</i>

17:31.210 --> 17:32.600
<i>I would.</i>

17:35.990 --> 17:40.660
And now, our circus's new star!

17:45.840 --> 17:50.670
<i>Ladies and Gentlemen, welcome 
to the Circus Night!</i>

17:51.250 --> 17:55.980
<i>The show's about to begin, so enjoy!</i>

17:55.980 --> 17:56.880
<i>Circus Night!</i>

17:56.880 --> 18:01.970
<i>The swing swings! The beasts roar!</i>

18:01.970 --> 18:10.470
<i>If we pull it off, give us a cheer 
that they can hear above ground</i>

18:11.810 --> 18:13.280
<i>Circus night!</i>

18:13.280 --> 18:23.980
<i>When the strongman breathes fire, 
it'll burn your boredom and you'll feel great</i>

18:23.980 --> 18:29.040
<i>Unique specs, Mysterious tricks</i>

18:29.040 --> 18:31.170
<i>Make you smile!</i>

18:31.170 --> 18:36.890
<i>Gemini on stage!</i>

18:38.090 --> 18:44.060
Sheesh... I gave you my spot. At least try 
to stand on stage like you belong there.

18:44.890 --> 18:48.020
Ooh! Next is Alice! She's so cute!

18:48.370 --> 18:49.930
Hey, Mister!

18:49.930 --> 18:51.730
You're with Circus Gemini, right?

18:52.720 --> 18:53.690
<i>They're hitting on me!</i>

18:55.320 --> 18:57.400
<i>I love party girls!</i>

18:58.000 --> 18:59.430
My name's Zain!

19:00.360 --> 19:02.600
Everybody calls me that, and you can, too!

19:02.600 --> 19:04.140
It's been a long time.

19:04.690 --> 19:06.580
Have we met?

19:06.580 --> 19:07.890
Teto...

19:07.890 --> 19:09.620
And Keto...

19:09.620 --> 19:12.040
And Daleth, too!

19:13.660 --> 19:15.750
Sorry, can you just leave?

19:16.270 --> 19:18.090
Or let me play with your boobs?

19:18.090 --> 19:18.970
Die.

19:19.710 --> 19:22.430
I didn't expect you to come 
all the way to Circus Gemini.

19:24.850 --> 19:30.060
Shake, shake, shake, shake...

19:26.090 --> 19:30.060
Zain, come back to the Witches' World with us.

19:30.370 --> 19:33.550
I need your time magic.

19:34.890 --> 19:36.110
<i>Crap...</i>

19:37.480 --> 19:39.960
<i>I'm falling to the dark side!</i>

19:40.320 --> 19:44.010
Daleth, is he really that amazing of a witch?

19:44.010 --> 19:44.930
Yes.

19:44.930 --> 19:48.410
That's why I brought enough firepower 
to overcome his defenses.

19:49.290 --> 19:51.470
My plant power.

19:52.620 --> 19:54.630
My poison.

19:55.470 --> 19:58.550
So what, you're going to hurt me?

20:00.280 --> 20:03.520
Not if you come with us.

20:03.520 --> 20:06.550
Of course, I won't have 
to threaten Cuff either.

20:08.440 --> 20:11.980
You're going to be a powerful mage one day.

20:16.810 --> 20:22.350
If you want to stop the terror,
 answer "yes" or "no."

20:27.920 --> 20:29.330
Why did they fall apart?

20:31.790 --> 20:33.970
I can use illusion magic, too.

20:34.560 --> 20:38.540
You knew my magic and used the same thing?

20:39.130 --> 20:40.930
You are a genius.

20:42.000 --> 20:43.530
A genius, huh?

20:46.020 --> 20:49.600
My answer to your question is "yes."

20:51.410 --> 20:53.670
I've been thinking about doing it anyway.

20:54.320 --> 20:56.380
I'll leave Cuff and the 
troupe behind in two days.

20:56.380 --> 20:57.230
Two days?

20:57.600 --> 21:01.250
Yes. Give me a day to say goodbye.

21:02.300 --> 21:03.180
I see.

21:03.180 --> 21:04.920
That makes me happy, Zain.

21:04.920 --> 21:07.170
We'll come back the day after tomorrow, then.

21:07.170 --> 21:08.750
<i>Bye-bye!</i>

21:23.850 --> 21:24.740
Cuff...

21:26.590 --> 21:28.590
I didn't get to see Alice!

23:03.370 --> 23:04.830
I'm disappointed.

23:05.630 --> 23:08.880
He lied to me and has 
no intention of coming.

23:11.850 --> 23:14.810
If you don't want to use 
your magic that badly,

23:14.810 --> 23:17.510
I'll just have to make 
sure you have no choice.

23:20.110 --> 23:21.920
I can't wait for tomorrow.

23:34.970 --> 23:40.250
The Duke of Death and His Maid
Cuff, Zain, and the Confession

23:35.710 --> 23:39.460
"Cuff, Zain, and the Confession."
